# [[in]] {{gloss|as part of something}}
#: {{ux|fr|inline=1|'''en''' équipe|'''on''' a team}}

=====Usage notes=====
* {{m|fr|en|En}} in the sense of ''while'' is often dropped when translated into English.
* When referring to location such as countries, provinces, or similar subdivisions in sense 1 and direction in sense 2, {{m|fr|en}} must be used when its name is either a feminine singular noun (not {{m|fr|à la}}) or a vowel-initial masculine singular noun (not {{m|fr|à l'}}). If the name for the very large location is a consonant-initial masculine singular noun, {{m|fr|au}} is used, while if the name of the very large location is plural, {{m|fr|aux}} is used.

